3. `arg` = `NoneType`. `field_annotation_is_scalar_sequence(NoneType)` will return `False` because `field_annotation_is_sequence(NoneType)` is `False`.
4. `field_annotation_is_scalar(NoneType)` is `True` (since `field_annotation_is_complex(NoneType)` is `False`).
